<event namespace="Christianity" start="1919" title="Commentary on Romans"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karl_Barth" title="Karl Barth">Karl Barth</a>'s <i>Commentary on Romans</i> is published, critiquing <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liberal_Christianity" title="Liberal Christianity">Liberal Christianity</a> and beginning the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neo-orthodoxy" title="Neo-orthodoxy">neo-orthodox movement</a> </event>
<event namespace="Christianity" start="1921" title="Oxford Group founded"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oxford_Group" title="Oxford Group">Oxford Group</a> founded at Oxford </event>
<event namespace="Christianity" start="1923" title="Angelus Temple built"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aimee_Semple_McPherson" title="Aimee Semple McPherson">Aimee Semple McPherson</a> built <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angelus_Temple" title="Angelus Temple">Angelus Temple</a> </event>
<event namespace="Christianity" start="1925" title="Scopes Trial divides Fundamentalists"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scopes_Trial" title="Scopes Trial">Scopes Trial</a>, caused division among Fundamentalists </event>
