<event namespace="Christianity" start="1927" title="Comma Johanneum open to dispute"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_Pius_XI" title="Pope Pius XI">Pope Pius XI</a> decrees <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Comma_Johanneum" title="Comma Johanneum">Comma Johanneum</a> open to dispute </event>
<event namespace="Christianity" start="1929" title="Lateran Treaty between Italy and Papacy"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lateran_Treaty" title="Lateran Treaty">Lateran Treaty</a> signed containing three agreements between kingdom of Italy and the papacy. </event>
