<event namespace="Christianity" start="1931" title="Christ the Redeemer statue"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christ_the_Redeemer_%28statue%29" title="Christ the Redeemer (statue)">Christ the Redeemer (statue)</a> in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil </event>
