<event namespace="Christianity" start="1935" title="Apostle to the Illiterates"> Dr. <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frank_C._Laubach" title="Frank C. Laubach">Frank C. Laubach</a>, known as "The Apostle to the Illiterates." working in the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philippines" title="Philippines">Philippines</a>, developed a literacy program that continues to teach millions of people to read. </event>
