<event namespace="Christianity" start="1939" title="The Methodist Church"> Southern and Northern US branches of the Methodist Episcopal Church, along with the Methodist Protestant Church reunite to form <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Methodist_Church" title="The Methodist Church">The Methodist Church</a>. Slavery had divided the church in the 1800s. </event>
