<event namespace="Christianity" start="1945" title="Roman Catholic sex abuse cases"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roman_Catholic_sex_abuse_cases" title="Roman Catholic sex abuse cases">Roman Catholic sex abuse cases</a> begins </event>
