<event namespace="Christianity" start="1947" title="Uneasy Conscience of Modern Fundamentalism"> <i>Uneasy Conscience of Modern Fundamentalism</i> by <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carl_F._H._Henry" title="Carl F. H. Henry">Carl F. H. Henry</a>, a landmark of Evangelicalism versus Fundamentalism in US </event>
