<event namespace="Christianity" start="1956" title="The Ten Commandments film"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Ten_Commandments_%281956_film%29" title="The Ten Commandments (1956 film)">The Ten Commandments (1956 film)</a> </event>
