<event namespace="Christianity" start="1978" end="2005" isDuration="true" title="Pope John Paul II"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pope_John_Paul_II" title="Pope John Paul II">Pope John Paul II</a>, reaffirmed conservative moral traditions (<i>The Splendor of Truth</i>) and the forbidding of women in the priesthood </event>
<event namespace="Christianity" start="1979" title="Moral Majority"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moral_Majority" title="Moral Majority">Moral Majority</a> founded by Jerry Falwell </event>
<event namespace="Christianity" start="1979" end="1982" isDuration="true" title="New King James Version"> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_King_James_Version" title="New King James Version">New King James Version</a>, complete revision of 1611 AV, updates archaisms while retaining style </event>
